# The corpus is a copy of the uniprotSeq corpus of DERNA
# (https://github.com/elkebir-group/derna, data/uniprotSeq/, commit adecda82)
# with the <= 500 aa filter applied — third-party data, not ours to vendor.
corpus/
# Full front records: every design's sequence, per protein. The tables derived
# from them (lattice.jsonl, binding.jsonl, f0/summary.csv) are what results
# reports read, and those are tracked.
f0/*.jsonl
f0/*.log
*.run.log
*.err
binding.jsonl

# Coordination and run logs: operational provenance, rewritten constantly. What
# matters from them is written up in prose (DISTURBED.md, the plan).
*.log
*.out

# The 501-700 aa band: a second corpus out of the same source, same filter at a
# different cut, and its full front records.
corpus-l/
f0-l/*.jsonl
f0-l/*.log
